orbis is an independent rewrite of CKAN, the Comprehensive Kerbal Archive
Network, and would not exist without it. It reads the metadata the CKAN
project publishes (CKAN-meta), and parts of orbis are ported from the CKAN
client's source code:

  - module version ordering (src/version.rs, from Core/Versioning/ModuleVersion.cs)
  - install stanza semantics: file, find, find_regexp, install_to, as,
    filter and include_only (src/install.rs, from Core/Types/ModuleInstallDescriptor.cs)
  - game version compatibility ranges and DLC detection
    (src/metadata.rs and src/game.rs, from Core/Types/GameComparator and
    Core/Games/KerbalSpaceProgram)
  - the archive.org mirror URLs and the list of redistributable licenses
    (src/metadata.rs, from Core/Types/CkanModule.cs and CKAN.schema)

